{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "NUM",
 "chapter": 24,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.1",
   "range": "NUM.24.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ff80b34e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.1#p1-ff80b34e",
     "text": "Where the Israelites camped.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "wilderness"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.3",
   "range": "NUM.24.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "11b69564",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.3#p1-11b69564",
     "text": "His eyes were shut up before in respect to the clear visions which he saw after.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "are open hath said"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.4",
   "range": "NUM.24.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4d92a308",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.4#p1-4d92a308",
     "text": "Though he lay as in a sleep, yet the eyes of his mind were open.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "falling into a trance"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.7",
   "range": "NUM.24.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0b905d85",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.7#p1-81654386",
     "text": "His prosperity and posterity will be very great.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "water out of his buckets"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.7#p2-fd2aafdb",
     "text": "Which name was common to the kings of Amalek.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "Agag"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.10",
   "range": "NUM.24.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c467a042",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.10#p1-c467a042",
     "text": "In token of anger.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "smote his hands together"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.11",
   "range": "NUM.24.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "be5b93bf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.11#p1-be5b93bf",
     "text": "Thus the wicked burden God when they cannot carry out their wicked enterprises.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "LORD hath kept thee back from"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.14",
   "range": "NUM.24.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "38c1e720",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.14#p1-38c1e720",
     "text": "He gave also wicked counsel to cause the Israelites to sin, that God might forsake them, Nu 31:16.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "advertise thee what this people shall",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 31:16",
       "ref": "NUM.31.16"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.17",
   "range": "NUM.24.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "db24dcdd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.17#p1-8d5475e4",
     "text": "Meaning Christ.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "Star out of Jacob"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.17#p2-44297cad",
     "text": "That is, the princes.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "corners of Moab"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.17#p3-2f37841a",
     "text": "He shall subdue all that resist: for of Sheth came Noah, and of Noah all the world.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "Sheth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.19",
   "range": "NUM.24.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5686def8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.19#p1-5686def8",
     "text": "Of the Edomites.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "city"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.20",
   "range": "NUM.24.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c38b08e0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.20#p1-c38b08e0",
     "text": "The Amalekites first made war against Israel, Nu 14:45.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "first of the nations",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 14:45",
       "ref": "NUM.14.45"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.21",
   "range": "NUM.24.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1bde7705",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.21#p1-1bde7705",
     "text": "Make yourself as strong as you can.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "puttest thy nest in a rock"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.23",
   "range": "NUM.24.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2024ab9d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.23#p1-2024ab9d",
     "text": "Some read, Oh who shall not perish when the enemy (that is, Antichrist) shall set himself up as God?",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "who shall live when God doeth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/NUM.24.24",
   "range": "NUM.24.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "06d2f162",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.24#p1-af54069a",
     "text": "The Grecians and Romans.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "Chittim"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/NUM.24.24#p2-5fb00b80",
     "text": "Meaning, Eber, or the Jews for rebelling against God.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "he also shall perish for ever"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
